From: Lưu Oa Oa <212658678+luuoaoa@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Drop TCVN as a Vietnamese input option

Remove the TCVN (vkd_vi_tcvn) entry from the m17n input-method manifest. TCVN is
a legacy 8-bit typing convention colorburst does not offer; Telex/VNI/VIQR remain.
diff --git a/chrome/browser/resources/chromeos/input_method/m17n_manifest.json b/chrome/browser/resources/chromeos/input_method/m17n_manifest.json
index 8a764ec278..66ce9278e9 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/chromeos/input_method/m17n_manifest.json
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/chromeos/input_method/m17n_manifest.json
@@ -145,14 +145,6 @@
         "us"
       ]
     },
-    {
-      "name": "__MSG_keyboard_vietnamese_tcvn__",
-      "id": "vkd_vi_tcvn",
-      "language": "vi",
-      "layouts": [
-        "us"
-      ]
-    },
     {
       "name": "__MSG_keyboard_vietnamese_telex__",
       "id": "vkd_vi_telex",
